        "line": 101,
        "text": "totalVelocity (s : State D) (c : Context D) : Oscillation D := fun n p => ![c.base.radial n p.1 + s.mean.radial n p.1 + s.oscillation n p 0, c.base.angular n p.1 + s.mean.angular n p.1 + s.oscillation n p 1, c.base.axial n p.1 + s.mean.axial n p.1 + s.oscillation n p 2]"
